StyleBox[\\\"2\\\", \\\"TR\\\"]]}], \\\"}\\\"}], \\\",\\\", \
StyleBox[\\\"s\\\", \\\"TI\\\"]}], \\\"]\\\"}]\\) represents an arrow with \
its ends set back from \\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[StyleBox[\\\"pt\\\", \
