StyleBox[\\\"max\\\", \\\"TI\\\"]]}], \\\"}\\\"}]}], \\\"]\\\"}]\\) generates \
a plot of the Hamiltonian vector field of the scalar-valued function \
\\!\\(\\*StyleBox[\\\"f\\\", \\\"TI\\\"]\\) as a function of \
\\!\\(\\*StyleBox[\\\"x\\\", \\\"TI\\\"]\\) and \\!\\(\\*StyleBox[\\\"y\\\", \
