Cell["\<\
The electric field (a vector field) is the negative gradient of the \
potential, and has the form shown below:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.394936762186983*^9, 3.39493680707568*^9}}],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

