StyleBox[\\\"\[Ellipsis]\\\", \\\"TR\\\"]}], \\\"}\\\"}]}], \\\",\\\", \
StyleBox[\\\"\[Ellipsis]\\\", \\\"TR\\\"]}], \\\"]\\\"}]\\) links the \
